   "finding": "Star dTS +0.05 pp p=0.937; dTO +0.74 pp p=0.00364 (wrong sign for shielding). Star-init TO~HasConn beta=+0.34 pp p=0.439. HasConn on-off PPP BOTH_NULL (mean -0.041 p=0.939, median +0.528 p=0.731, n=73). Frequent-conn lin [cut; read_family for the full text]"
